Sheet 1 1
Title "ICStation 17-Key USB Numeric Keypad - Approximate Reverse-Engineered Schematic"
Comment1 "Model GY22034-1 / Amazon B0GDXYJ1RZ"
Comment2 "VERIFY MCU, GPIO ASSIGNMENTS, DIODE ORIENTATION AND COMPONENT VALUES"
